    {"topic": "Metaphor of flooding the bed", "example": "אַשְׂחֶה … מִטָּתִי … עַרְשִׂי אַמְסֶה", "note": "Hyperbolic lament imagery: tears are portrayed as enough to make the bed 'swim'."},
